WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 19=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(The Birth of Gunpowder)

00:43.320 --> 00:44.080
Oh, man!

00:47.719 --> 00:48.400
Marquis!

00:50.080 --> 00:51.240
Marquis Wei!

00:55.439 --> 00:56.080
Marquis,

00:56.599 --> 00:57.560
how are you feeling?

00:58.679 --> 00:59.239
I'm fine.

01:07.359 --> 01:08.960
What happened here?

01:10.600 --> 01:12.199
I was over there studying gunpowder,

01:12.960 --> 01:14.480
but I accidentally lost control.

01:14.679 --> 01:15.479
As a result,

01:15.759 --> 01:16.799
it caught fire.

01:17.399 --> 01:18.719
So it was gunpowder.

01:19.159 --> 01:20.240
How is the research going?

01:20.900 --> 01:22.840
This man is a manager
in our Ministry of Works.

01:22.840 --> 01:24.439
He talks about researching
gunpowder every day.

01:24.439 --> 01:26.200
He saw some charlatans

01:26.200 --> 01:28.159
make some soil that could burn,

01:28.359 --> 01:29.880
so he wanted to make it himself.

01:29.880 --> 01:30.600
In the end,

01:30.600 --> 01:32.439
it's been three years with zero progress.

01:32.759 --> 01:33.560
Gunpowder

01:34.039 --> 01:35.719
actually has many great uses.

01:36.399 --> 01:37.320
If we can figure it out,

01:37.320 --> 01:39.560
it would be
a huge help to the Great Yong.

01:40.520 --> 01:41.439
Marquis Wei,

01:41.759 --> 01:43.320
you have a keen eye.

01:43.679 --> 01:45.479
If this gunpowder is handled well,

01:45.679 --> 01:48.040
it will have a massive impact.

01:48.200 --> 01:48.959
For example,

01:48.959 --> 01:49.840
it can ignite

01:49.920 --> 01:52.359
things we usually can't set on fire.

01:52.519 --> 01:53.319
Also,

01:53.400 --> 01:55.000
if our army

01:55.519 --> 01:57.319
is fighting the enemy,

01:57.319 --> 01:59.719
and we put some
gunpowder on their rations,

01:59.879 --> 02:00.760
and once ignited,

02:00.760 --> 02:03.280
the fire will spread instantly.

02:03.439 --> 02:04.239
At that point,

02:04.239 --> 02:07.000
the enemy won't
even have time to put it out.

02:07.000 --> 02:07.640
This way,

02:07.640 --> 02:08.879
we would be able to

02:09.000 --> 02:12.760
quickly destroy
the enemy's food supplies.

02:12.760 --> 02:13.680
What a load of rubbish.

02:14.040 --> 02:15.680
Wouldn't gasoline be faster?

02:15.680 --> 02:16.680
Gasoline?

02:16.680 --> 02:17.200
You...

02:17.200 --> 02:18.519
You're just wasting gunpowder.

02:18.640 --> 02:20.159
Marquis Wei, from what you are saying,

02:20.359 --> 02:22.239
it sounds like you
know how to make it too?

02:23.480 --> 02:24.799
(This young brat)

02:24.799 --> 02:27.220
(actually dares to say he can
make gunpowder in front of me?)

02:27.599 --> 02:28.519
Marquis Wei,

02:29.760 --> 02:32.519
I am much older than you.

02:32.959 --> 02:35.680
You really shouldn't talk so big.

02:36.159 --> 02:37.120
Is this gunpowder

02:37.280 --> 02:39.239
something a person your age

02:39.239 --> 02:40.400
could create?

02:40.400 --> 02:41.200
It's not that hard.

02:41.799 --> 02:42.680
Just wait.

02:42.690 --> 02:45.000
I'll whip some up for you right now
to show you how it's done.

02:45.000 --> 02:45.640
Minister Duan,

02:45.640 --> 02:46.799
get me some bamboo tubes.

02:47.239 --> 02:48.400
Bam... Bamboo tubes?

02:48.400 --> 02:49.319
Don't you know what they are?

02:49.319 --> 02:50.040
Go on.

02:50.040 --> 02:50.439
What's wrong?

02:50.439 --> 02:51.860
Are you afraid
I will burn down the Ministry?

02:51.879 --> 02:53.159
You should ask around about me.

02:53.159 --> 02:54.120
I'm loaded.

02:54.130 --> 02:56.719
With what I earn in a day,
I could buy several of these buildings.

02:56.719 --> 02:57.360
Now go.

02:57.919 --> 03:01.560
Marquis, let's just hurry
and focus on the refined salt.

03:01.759 --> 03:03.120
This gunpowder isn't important.

03:03.120 --> 03:03.840
It's fine.

03:04.120 --> 03:05.360
It won't take long.

03:05.500 --> 03:07.120
I don't want
those people in the Ministry

03:07.120 --> 03:09.039
looking down on me every day,

03:09.039 --> 03:10.400
acting like they're so great.

03:11.039 --> 03:12.120
I'm not bragging,

03:12.639 --> 03:14.599
but across everyone

03:14.719 --> 03:16.280
in the entire Ministry,

03:16.290 --> 03:17.520
when it comes to making things,

03:17.800 --> 03:18.879
if I say I'm second,

03:18.879 --> 03:20.190
who would dare claim to be first?

03:21.520 --> 03:22.360
Go.

03:22.599 --> 03:23.400
Get moving.

03:28.159 --> 03:29.599
(No wonder His Majesty said)

03:29.879 --> 03:32.479
(that Wei the Fool
never thinks before he speaks.)

03:32.490 --> 03:34.560
(The things he says
are enough to infuriate anyone.)

03:34.610 --> 03:36.520
(Heaven knows
how many people he has offended.)

03:37.562 --> 03:39.237
(Ganlu Palace)

03:39.287 --> 03:40.600
(Stillborns from close kin.
Proof from Ancient Teachings and Laws)

03:41.280 --> 03:43.639
This is regarding
marriages between close relatives?

03:45.759 --> 03:46.560
Your Majesty,

03:47.039 --> 03:47.840
my family

03:48.960 --> 03:50.240
is in the same situation.

03:50.599 --> 03:52.080
We didn't know why before,

03:52.479 --> 03:53.439
but I never expected

03:54.039 --> 03:54.719
it to be...

03:57.919 --> 03:58.719
Your Majesty,

03:58.800 --> 04:00.639
this matter deserves our full attention.

04:00.759 --> 04:01.800
If this is true,

04:01.800 --> 04:03.240
we must strictly enforce this.

04:03.479 --> 04:04.360
The Great Yong's

04:04.479 --> 04:05.800
population is already small.

04:06.439 --> 04:07.599
During the previous wars,

04:07.719 --> 04:09.919
many people lost their lives.

04:10.639 --> 04:13.120
Now that Great Yong has
become somewhat stable,

04:13.199 --> 04:15.680
this is exactly when we
need to grow our population.

04:20.919 --> 04:21.719
Your Majesty,

04:22.000 --> 04:24.120
why the sudden investigation into this?

04:24.439 --> 04:27.560
Wei Hao mentioned it to Ning'an before.

04:27.639 --> 04:28.960
(Wei Hao again.)

04:29.039 --> 04:29.680
Then,

04:30.199 --> 04:32.840
the Empress and I sent
people to investigate further.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.360
Ministry of Revenue,

04:34.960 --> 04:37.280
you all must send men
to investigate again.

04:37.520 --> 04:38.840
If it is the case,

04:39.240 --> 04:40.360
from this day forward,

04:40.360 --> 04:42.719
marriages between
close relatives must be banned.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.159
Naturally,

04:45.719 --> 04:48.599
the Ministry of Rites and
Personnel should also promote this.

04:48.599 --> 04:49.280
- Yes.
- Yes.

04:49.280 --> 04:50.879
Especially for the local officials,

04:51.400 --> 04:53.879
we must ensure
they handle this strictly.

04:54.520 --> 04:57.280
We cannot allow
such things to happen anymore.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.240
Look at this.

04:59.600 --> 05:01.319
It is horrifying.

05:01.639 --> 05:03.240
How many children have died young

05:03.680 --> 05:05.560
every year because of this?

05:06.040 --> 05:07.160
How many adults

05:08.090 --> 05:09.560
have lost their lives along with them?

05:09.680 --> 05:10.480
Yes.

05:15.399 --> 05:16.199
Someone, come here.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.279
Your Majesty.

05:18.560 --> 05:21.240
Do you know where that sound came from?

05:21.439 --> 05:22.279
Your Majesty,

05:22.480 --> 05:24.639
it sounded like it came
from the Ministry of Works.

05:26.319 --> 05:27.120
Your Majesty,

05:27.600 --> 05:28.879
I'll go and take a look.

05:29.000 --> 05:29.639
Fine.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.360
The rest of you, go to the dining hall

05:38.720 --> 05:40.199
and stay for lunch.

05:40.199 --> 05:41.199
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:41.639 --> 05:42.439
Fuji,

05:43.000 --> 05:44.040
you stay for a moment.

05:54.079 --> 05:54.879
Fuji,

05:56.199 --> 05:57.000
about this matter,

05:57.279 --> 05:58.920
at first, the Empress and I

05:58.920 --> 06:01.319
thought Ning'an
made it up to deceive us.

06:01.319 --> 06:02.199
I never expected

06:02.439 --> 06:03.639
it to be true.

06:04.160 --> 06:04.959
Therefore,

06:05.439 --> 06:07.399
regarding the marriage
between Ning'an and Chong,

06:07.920 --> 06:10.839
we really need to consider it carefully.

06:10.959 --> 06:13.879
(With these reports, is there even
anything left to consider?)

06:14.079 --> 06:16.800
(His Majesty and my sister
will certainly not agree now.)

06:18.800 --> 06:19.600
Your Majesty,

06:19.800 --> 06:21.560
if it is as the reports say,

06:21.560 --> 06:24.279
we should indeed give
it some serious thought.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.199
Your Majesty,

06:27.000 --> 06:28.199
Duke Cheng has sent word.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.180
Marquis Wei was the one
who caused that commotion.

06:30.199 --> 06:31.319
Wei the Fool?

06:32.399 --> 06:33.959
What is he up to now?

06:35.560 --> 06:36.600
(Wei Hao,)

06:36.680 --> 06:38.720
(you have repeatedly displeased me.)

06:38.959 --> 06:41.480
(Don't blame me for being hard on you.)

06:44.287 --> 06:45.825
(Ganlu Palace)

06:45.879 --> 06:46.959
What happened here?

06:46.959 --> 06:47.839
Greetings, officials.

06:49.920 --> 06:50.720
Wei Hao,

06:51.639 --> 06:52.920
what is going on?

06:53.519 --> 06:54.319
Father-in...

06:56.060 --> 06:57.319
(Can I still not call him that?)

06:57.319 --> 06:59.199
(I thought I could
once I was out of prison?)

06:59.360 --> 07:00.160
(No.)

07:01.199 --> 07:04.680
Your Majesty, didn't I go to the Ministry
of Works to check the salt?

07:04.680 --> 07:06.890
I helped them prepare
some gunpowder while I was at it.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.800
Since it was the first experiment,

07:08.800 --> 07:10.399
I added just a little bit too much.

07:11.920 --> 07:13.000
So,

07:13.279 --> 07:15.560
(Ganlu Palace)
you were the one behind all this noise?

07:17.279 --> 07:18.079
Your Majesty,

07:18.839 --> 07:20.839
Wei Hao has disturbed your presence.

07:20.839 --> 07:23.160
I believe he should
be severely punished.

07:23.839 --> 07:24.800
Who are you?

07:25.360 --> 07:26.160
Wei Hao,

07:26.759 --> 07:28.360
this is Minister Zhangsun.

07:28.720 --> 07:29.800
Do not be so rude.

07:30.600 --> 07:32.360
(Zhangsun Chong's father?)

07:34.079 --> 07:35.000
Oh, Uncle.

07:35.000 --> 07:36.120
What do you mean by "Uncle"?

07:36.800 --> 07:38.560
Aren't you my uncle whose son

07:38.839 --> 07:40.920
wants to marry Ning'an?

07:41.720 --> 07:43.040
You brat! How dare you...

07:43.040 --> 07:44.199
It really is you.

07:44.240 --> 07:45.800
Well, I have a few things to say to you.

07:45.800 --> 07:46.759
(Ganlu Palace)
Wei the Fool.

07:46.759 --> 07:47.519
Your Majesty!

07:50.680 --> 07:51.480
Your Majesty,

07:51.720 --> 07:55.319
Marquis Wei just helped the Ministry
of Works formulate gunpowder.

07:55.560 --> 07:57.160
This gunpowder is incredibly powerful.

07:57.600 --> 07:59.199
If it is used by the military,

07:59.319 --> 08:01.839
the strength of the Great Yong army

08:01.839 --> 08:03.120
will be greatly enhanced.

08:03.560 --> 08:06.439
It could reduce casualties
by at least 70 percent.

08:09.319 --> 08:10.160
Is the stuff

08:10.519 --> 08:11.480
that useful?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.040
Wei Hao,

08:14.879 --> 08:16.040
this gun...

08:16.720 --> 08:17.519
powder,

08:18.120 --> 08:19.199
what is it all about?

08:19.199 --> 08:21.439
Your Majesty,
we've already tested it at the Ministry.

08:21.439 --> 08:22.879
We accidentally blew up a house.

08:23.079 --> 08:24.439
Its power is not an issue.

08:24.759 --> 08:25.279
Yes,

08:25.600 --> 08:27.040
Marquis Wei is telling the truth.

08:27.639 --> 08:28.600
Everyone

08:28.839 --> 08:30.279
at the Ministry of Works can testify.

08:30.319 --> 08:32.759
The power of this gunpowder is shocking.

08:32.759 --> 08:34.399
It left them all stunned.

08:34.600 --> 08:37.040
And this is just the crude gunpowder.

08:37.040 --> 08:38.079
Once I've refined it,

08:38.079 --> 08:39.920
I bet I could blow down city walls.

08:40.399 --> 08:41.360
What?

08:41.720 --> 08:42.600
Blow down city walls?

08:44.480 --> 08:45.279
Wei Hao,

08:45.519 --> 08:47.600
stop talking nonsense here.

08:49.519 --> 08:51.439
The proof of
the pudding is in the eating.

08:51.439 --> 08:52.800
If you don't believe it,

08:52.920 --> 08:54.680
I can demonstrate

08:54.839 --> 08:56.160
the power of the gunpowder now.

08:56.959 --> 08:57.759
Your Majesty,

08:57.920 --> 09:00.319
(Ganlu Palace)
I heard the explosion from the Ministry,

09:00.319 --> 09:02.079
which sounded just like thunder.

09:02.680 --> 09:04.279
I would also like to see

09:04.279 --> 09:06.360
exactly what this gunpowder is.

09:07.040 --> 09:08.319
I want to see it too!

09:10.959 --> 09:11.519
Fine.

09:11.920 --> 09:13.639
Minister Duan, give me the gunpowder.

09:14.720 --> 09:15.480
Your Majesty,

09:15.480 --> 09:17.639
the power of this gunpowder is too great.

09:17.720 --> 09:19.399
Please, Your Majesty and officials,

09:19.440 --> 09:21.320
move to an open area for the test.

09:21.919 --> 09:22.759
No need.

09:22.799 --> 09:23.639
Let's begin.

09:27.919 --> 09:28.879
Blow it up right here?

09:29.320 --> 09:29.879
Blow it.

09:42.519 --> 09:43.320
Your Majesty,

09:43.919 --> 09:45.639
the gunpowder is very powerful.

09:45.879 --> 09:47.919
It's better if you
all stay further back.

09:48.159 --> 09:49.240
Is this not far enough?

09:49.240 --> 09:50.039
Not enough.

09:50.039 --> 09:51.580
There will be a shockwave in a moment.

09:51.600 --> 09:52.799
Come on, move back.

09:55.519 --> 09:56.320
Your Majesty,

09:56.559 --> 09:57.679
your health is paramount.

09:57.799 --> 09:59.639
It would be best to watch from above.

10:01.159 --> 10:01.799
Fine.

10:08.159 --> 10:10.240
Uncle, you should head up quickly too.

10:11.000 --> 10:13.159
Stop trying to claim a relation with me.

10:13.639 --> 10:15.120
At my age,

10:15.120 --> 10:17.000
is there anything I haven't seen?

10:17.480 --> 10:19.120
Could this little bit of gunpowder

10:19.639 --> 10:21.600
really bother me?

10:22.360 --> 10:24.080
Some people are just beyond help.

10:41.462 --> 10:44.292
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

10:44.912 --> 10:48.312
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

10:49.082 --> 10:52.032
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

10:52.372 --> 10:55.072
♪Sigh and walk away♪

10:56.672 --> 11:00.142
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:00.142 --> 11:02.372
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:02.372 --> 11:04.482
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:04.482 --> 11:06.502
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:06.502 --> 11:10.862
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

11:12.302 --> 11:16.032
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

11:16.302 --> 11:19.902
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

11:20.062 --> 11:22.142
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

11:22.142 --> 11:26.932
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

11:27.152 --> 11:28.772
♪The world mistakes me♪

11:28.772 --> 11:31.112
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

11:31.182 --> 11:32.372
♪As the storm approaches♪

11:32.372 --> 11:34.772
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

11:34.982 --> 11:36.702
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

11:36.702 --> 11:38.682
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

11:38.852 --> 11:40.602
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

11:40.602 --> 11:42.702
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

11:42.702 --> 11:44.172
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

11:44.172 --> 11:46.402
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

11:46.622 --> 11:47.822
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

11:47.822 --> 11:50.342
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

11:50.472 --> 11:52.182
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

11:52.182 --> 11:53.462
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

11:53.612 --> 11:55.032
♪My wish has finally come true♪

11:55.032 --> 11:56.072
♪To stay by your side♪

11:56.072 --> 11:57.992
♪In this fleeting world♪

11:58.162 --> 12:01.412
♪We are free and happy♪

12:05.412 --> 12:07.192
♪From a nobody♪

12:07.192 --> 12:09.092
♪To someone now famous♪

12:09.202 --> 12:10.632
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:10.632 --> 12:13.142
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

12:13.242 --> 12:14.822
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

12:14.822 --> 12:16.892
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

12:17.102 --> 12:18.782
♪In this vast world♪

12:18.782 --> 12:20.782
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

12:20.932 --> 12:23.142
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

12:23.142 --> 12:24.732
♪Everything ends eventually♪

12:24.822 --> 12:26.322
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

12:26.322 --> 12:28.722
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

12:28.722 --> 12:30.432
♪No matter how time flies♪

12:30.432 --> 12:31.592
♪Even if the falling snow♪

12:31.592 --> 12:33.222
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

12:33.222 --> 12:34.262
♪All I want now♪

12:34.262 --> 12:36.362
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

12:36.362 --> 12:39.622
♪Year after year♪
